71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b0t5Rpbc3nAQ7kNvwENJbGX&_nc_oc=AdrrGgPqPcdb4c5f1qXmck4jOxSTdl8nLz09yFynKjgafyGjfTjGDJctGV4mwq52qCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHahPKUKxIGMZC5dBpfe5o01rAyN5SwGNODJcf419eRPg&oe=6A7B1F39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9Q18CMFiE1UQ7kNvwFFCzwa&_nc_oc=AdoLgbvxjx7Sg19_XCeV20Ug0y26CmcTVNIukaAoHttVh8zWxyw_xCprF2xJWRebFLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFDIjlEXeVTLhKYDpFB9HHMTd8gGVsLFnk4PKBDL8n2pw&oe=6A7B3213"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2M10Qwk3kwQ7kNvwFoXrGW&_nc_oc=AdrC_8vMDiFzIwvM4PEcNDPzq2qwNtv6jYOVxzY-QeOq0bQpqlqDEtsc5W9HCSX8oDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEYDXo_HwDqWDq-A8aedrCObzURzpKBN_xb06zv75nf9w&oe=6A7B305A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: